From: Jesus David Saavedra Latorre <iam.jesusd88@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:16:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/20] fix(digitizer): send back/forward as mouse buttons and
 tame scroll and pinch

Edge swipe and flick keycodes that are mouse buttons are now pressed in the
fallback mouse report and released in the next one instead of tap_code16.
The mac keymap uses mouse buttons 4/5 for back/forward (layout independent),
scroll divisor 150, pinch divisor 250 and a 25% edge zone.
