+Edge swipe and flick keycodes are tapped with `tap_code16()`, except mouse buttons (`QK_MOUSE_BUTTON_1` to `QK_MOUSE_BUTTON_8`, also `MS_BTN1` to `MS_BTN8`), which are sent in the trackpad's own mouse report: pressed in the next report and released in the one after it, so the click is never lost or stuck. Mouse buttons 4 and 5 (`QK_MOUSE_BUTTON_4`, `QK_MOUSE_BUTTON_5`) are back and forward in most browsers and do not depend on the keyboard layout, unlike `Cmd+[` / `Cmd+]`:
