 /**
  * @brief Gets the current digitizer mouse report, the pointing device feature will send this is we
  * nave fallen back to mouse mode.
  *
+ * The pointing device task calls this on every run and sends the report whenever it changed, so
+ * a gesture button pressed in one report is always released in the next one.
+ *
  * @return report_mouse_t
